1
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:58,500
They Never Thought It Would Happen Again

2
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:51,000
Britannic is a action, drama, history film directed by Brian Trenchard-Smith.

3
00:11:37,500 --> 00:11:43,500
It was the sister ship of the infamous Titanic...

4
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:36,000
and its final destiny was the same.

5
00:19:22,500 --> 00:19:28,500
Experience the true untold story of Britannic, a tumultuous, epic voyage of human passion,
courage and betrayal aboard an ill-fated ocean liner bound for a shattering demise.

6
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:21,000
With the world at war, an undercover British agent (Amanda Ryan), embarks the Britannic
in search of a German spy believed to be on board to sabotage the ship.

7
00:27:07,500 --> 00:27:13,500
Posing as a governess, the undercover agent finds herself falling
in love with the ship's chaplain (Edward Atterton).

8
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:06,000
In a stunning discovery, the lovers suddenly find themselves enemies of war.

9
00:34:52,500 --> 00:34:58,500
And when a massive explosion deals a deathblow to the ship,
their battle becomes one for their own survival.

10
00:38:45,000 --> 00:38:51,000
With a dynamic, international cast and a story line that hosts a chilling tale of espionage, politics and
romance, Britannic brings one of history's most devastating events to riveting, new life.

11
00:42:37,500 --> 00:42:43,500
Vera Campbell, played by Amanda Ryan.

12
00:46:30,000 --> 00:46:36,000
Reynolds, played by Edward Atterton.

13
00:50:22,500 --> 00:50:28,500
Lady Lewis, played by Jacqueline Bisset.

14
00:54:15,000 --> 00:54:21,000
Townsend, played by Ben Daniels.

15
00:58:07,500 --> 00:58:13,500
Captain Barrett, played by John Rhys-Davies.

16
01:02:00,000 --> 01:02:06,000
Doctor Baker, played by Bruce Payne.

17
01:05:52,500 --> 01:05:58,500
Britannic is a 2000 spy television film directed by Brian Trenchard-Smith.

18
01:09:45,000 --> 01:09:51,000
The film depicts a heavily fictionalized version of
the sinking of HMHS Britannic in 1916.

19
01:13:37,500 --> 01:13:43,500
The film portrays a German agent sabotaging her while she is serving as a
hospital ship for the British Army during World War I.

20
01:17:30,000 --> 01:17:36,000
It stars Edward Atterton and Amanda Ryan, with Jacqueline Bisset, Ben
Daniels, John Rhys-Davies, and Bruce Payne as co-stars.

21
01:21:22,500 --> 01:21:28,500
It first premiered on cable network Fox Family and was then
broadcast in the United Kingdom on Channel 4.

22
01:25:15,000 --> 01:25:21,000
The film explores themes of ship, world war i,
spy, shipwreck, based on true story.

23
01:29:07,500 --> 01:29:13,500
The tone is emotional.
